Function Purpose <code>DefaultConfig()</code> the embedded mapping (<code>config/enerplanet-to-meme.json</code>, shipped by the <code>config</code> package), parsed when the package initialises <code>DefaultConfigJSON()</code> a copy of its JSON text <code>LoadConfig(data []byte)</code> parse and validate a configuration <code>LoadConfigFile(path string)</code> the same from a file <p>A <code>Config</code> is immutable after loading and safe to share. Its exported fields <code>Name</code>, <code>Version</code> and <code>Description</code> carry the metadata from the file.</p> <pre><code>cfg, err := t1k.LoadConfigFile("orders.json")
if err != nil {
    return err // wraps t1k.ErrConfig; the message names the offending rule
}
task := t1k.NewTransformTask(t1k.WithConfig(cfg), t1k.WithIndent("", "  "))
</code></pre>
